{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50781","headline":"酬房子客郊居六韵 · 张祜","name":"酬房子客郊居六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三亩田东竹一墟，习家深处自安居。\n每逢山简能骑马，长羡王弘不卖鱼。\n南国烟帆低晚岸，北林霜叶堕寒蔬。\n郡中旧指贤哉巷，门外多来长者车。\n近日稍闻池尽墨，他时谁见壁藏书。\n已知每提能携酒，同倚阊门四槛虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}